            "review_title": "Review at Trang An Riverside Restaurant and Bar",
            "review_text": "Mirjam\nWeesp, The Netherlands18 contributions\n0\nGood food,\nAug 2025 • Family\nWhen we came from the boat trip in the afternoon it was very busy here. So we decided to have dinner here in the evening. Unfortunately we were the only guests then. We were very friendly and the food was good.\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten August 6, 2025",
